00:08:41.554 --> 00:08:43.055
has the votes to do it.

00:08:43.055 --> 00:08:45.057
So, you know, from the Democrats

00:08:45.057 --> 00:08:46.158
perspective, it's probably best

00:08:46.158 --> 00:08:47.593
to let them fight it out.

00:08:47.593 --> 00:08:48.628
But comments like that

00:08:48.628 --> 00:08:49.695
certainly don't help.

00:08:49.695 --> 00:08:53.766
And but I would say to Matt Gaetz is up

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:55.568
to Matt Gaetz his point,

00:08:55.568 --> 00:08:56.068
I think there

00:08:56.068 --> 00:08:57.503
there is some legitimate concern

00:08:57.503 --> 00:08:59.539
about where exactly the line here is

00:08:59.739 --> 00:09:00.439
when it comes

00:09:00.439 --> 00:09:01.841
to punishing members

00:09:01.841 --> 00:09:03.643
of Congress for things that they say

00:09:03.643 --> 00:09:04.810
and that's still being worked out.

00:09:06.546 --> 00:09:06.913
Yeah, and I

00:09:06.913 --> 00:09:07.413
also think there's

00:09:07.413 --> 00:09:08.447
a larger conversation

00:09:08.447 --> 00:09:10.483
to be had about apologies and,

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:13.219
you know, allowing people to grow,

00:09:13.219 --> 00:09:14.754
whether they're Democrats or Republicans,

00:09:14.754 --> 00:09:15.888
are not affiliated at all.

00:09:15.888 --> 00:09:17.857
Abby Phillip and Jackie Kucinich,

00:09:17.857 --> 00:09:18.524
thanks so much.

